OL,3,GNEWSAEllis Cox family hope increased
OL,4,A#100k reward will give 'closure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a teenager who was shot
OL,7,Fdead two years ago has said they hope
OL,8,Fan increased #100,000 reward will
OL,9,Fencourage someone to come forward with
OL,10,Fthe information needed to catch the
OL,11,Fkiller.
OL,13,FEllis Cox, 19, died after he was shot
OL,14,Fin the back on the Liver Industrial
OL,15,FEstate in Aintree, Merseyside, in June
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FAn initial #20,000 reward from
OL,19,FCrimestoppers was matched by his family
OL,20,Fin April and now an anonymous donor has
OL,21,Fgiven a further #60,000.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
