OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEllis Cox family hope increased
OL,4,A#100k reward will give 'closure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCox's aunt Julie O'Toole said the
OL,7,Ffamily hoped the higher reward would
OL,8,F"give us closure" and "get justice for
OL,9,FEllis and for us and for his mum". Ten
OL,10,Fpeople have been arrested in connection
OL,11,Fwith Ellis's death but no-one has been
OL,12,Fcharged.
